      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mtext>a&#160;prime&#160;number</mtext></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mtext>a&#160;composite&#160;number</mtext></mfenced></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>(a prime number)<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;(a composite number)<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>,</p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mtext>success</mtext><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Number of trials,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;required mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
